<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/aos/aos.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/bottstrap 5 modified/bootstrap.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/logo_green.png">

</head>

<body>
    <div class="row align-items-center text-center text-md-left">

        <!-- Logo -->
        <div class="nav-link col-12 col-md-6 mt-3">
            <img src="/images/logo_green.png" alt="Logo" class="img-fluid">
        </div>
        <!-- Shop Now Button -->
        
    
        
    
        <!-- Login/Signup Buttons -->
        <div class="col-12 col-md-6 mt-3 d-flex justify-content-center justify-content-md-end">
            <a href="/shop" class="me-2">
                <button class="reg">Shop Now</button>
            </a>
            <a  href="/partner/login" class="me-2 dissapear">
                <button class="log">Business</button>
            </a>
            <a href="/user/login" class="me-2 dissapear">
                <button class="reg">Log In</button>
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>


    <section style="width: 100%;">

        <div class="container about">
            <section>
                <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="3000" class="mt-5">
                    <div class="row">
                        <p class="head"><span style="color: #8cc342;">About</span> Us</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row">
                        <p style="word-spacing: 5px;" class="p1">
                            Fighting Food Waste together
                        </p>
                    </div>


                </div>

            </section>

            <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="3000" class="row mt-5">

                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <p style="text-align: start;" class="head"><span style="color: #8cc342;">Our</span><br>Business<br>
                        Model</p>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <p style="text-align: start;" class="info">At Grap The Goodies, we're on a mission to create a
                        win-win-win for people, profit, and the planet. <br><br> Our goal is to rescue good food from
                        going to
                        waste and make an impact by turning surplus into savings for everyone. <br><br> By offering
                        businesses a
                        chance to profit from surplus food, consumers the joy of quality meals at unbeatable prices, and
                        our communities the opportunity to take meaningful action, we’re creating a movement to protect
                        our environment.
                </div>

            </div>

            <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="3000" class="row">
                <img src="/images/dash.png" alt="">
            </div>

            <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="3000" class="row">
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <p class="info">At Grap The Goodies, we’re dedicated to scaling our impact and empowering
                        communities around the world to fight food waste together. As we grow, so does our ability to
                        make a meaningful difference—reaching more people, businesses, and partners every day. <br><br>
                        Currently, Grap The Goodies is active in multiple countries across several continents, and we’re
                        continuously expanding our presence to bring the benefits of rescued food to new regions. <br>
                        <br> We’re
                        proud to be part of a global movement, inspiring individuals and organizations alike to join us
                        in reducing waste and creating a more sustainable future for all.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <p style="text-align: end;" class="head"><span style="color: #8cc342;">Impact</span> Around <br>
                        The <br> world</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="3000" class="row">
                <img src="/images/dashed 2.png" alt="">
            </div>

            <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="3000" class="row">

                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <p style="text-align: start;" class="head"><span style="color: #8cc342;">How</span> Does <br>
                        Grap The Goodies <br>Work ?</p>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <p class="info">Grap The Goodies has a website that lets users buy unsold, surplus food from cafes,
                        restaurants, food stores and hotels. It’s all in the name of stopping delicious, perfectly
                        edible food from going to waste. <br> <br>

                        When businesses have unsold food, they list it on Grap The Goodies. Customers use the app to buy
                        this food for a great price, then pick it up at a time set by the store. <br> <br>

                        The food is bundled up in what we call “Surprise Bags”. So beyond knowing the gist of what their
                        order will contain (for example sandwiches and salads, or muffins and pastries), users only find
                        out what they get when they collect their order. As well as making for a delicious surprise, it
                        ensures stores have the flexibility to sell genuine surplus food.</p>
                </div>

            </div>

        </div>


    </section>



     <!-- footer -->


     <div class="footer mt-5">
        <div class="horzintal-line mx-auto mt-5"></div>
